      "body": "# 2026-11-07\n\n## Ship-wide graphics — applied and saved\n\nAfter importing `/Game/ShipEnvironment`, the user requested realistic graphics across the ship, including walls and equipment. The first corridor-only pass was expanded to every compartment in the default ship and shared fire-free environment.\n\nEach environment now has 114 imported wall panels, service fittings in all ten rooms, ten detailed hatch leaves, two detailed exhausts and 48 wall kickplates. Twenty-six copied materials improve equipment/environment surfaces; original assets, sign texts/positions and GameMode were preserved. Final surface grain removes the atlas-pattern artifacts found in intermediate previews.\n\nSaved reload verification completed at 12:26:58 UTC with zero errors. Eleven final room/corridor previews and full recovery records are linked in [[Ship Realism — Imported Environment]]. No Play/VR or headset performance test was performed. Most equipment retains its original geometry because the imported pack has no complete equipment replacement models.\n\nSee [[Ship Environments]], [[Docs Index]], [[Python Scripts Index]] and [[TODO — Roadmap]].",
