      "body": "# All 42 playable worlds\n\nSource of routes: `Tools/Docs/MENU_ROUTES.json`. The menu is a separate startup map (`/Game/NavalFireVR/Menu_v1/L_NavalMenu`), and the shared ship environment is a sublevel, not an extra selectable world.\n\n## What the worlds contain today\n\n- **Default (groupe d'attaque × F):** the expanded ship, animated non-explorable sea, readable signs, galley electrical-appliance fire, eight usable CO2 cylinders, power-isolation switch, French objective guide, Backspace reset, and ZQSD/Ctrl/Shift desktop controls. The menu says Classe F by request, but this exercise is still an electrical fire; cooking-oil fire behavior is pending.\n- **Other 41 worlds:** separate route maps that load the shared ship and sea without a fire. They have the common environment and desktop GameMode, but no role-specific drill, fire effects, or objective sequence yet. The selected role and fire type are route labels for future implementation.\n\n## Route inventory\n\n| # | Role | Menu fire type | Unreal level | Current content |\n|---:|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | groupe d'attaque | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_attaque_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 2 | groupe d'attaque | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_attaque_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 3 | groupe d'attaque | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_attaque_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 4 | groupe d'attaque | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_attaque_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 5 | groupe d'attaque | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/ExpandedShip/Build_001/L_SECUREX_Expanded` | Playable galley electrical fire + CO2 drill; Classe F conversion pending |\n| 6 | groupe d'attaque | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_attaque_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 7 | DDL | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 8 | DDL | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 9 | DDL | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 10 | DDL | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 11 | DDL | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 12 | DDL | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddl_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 13 | DDI | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 14 | DDI | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 15 | DDI | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 16 | DDI | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 17 | DDI | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 18 | DDI | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_ddi_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 19 | équipe d'alarme | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 20 | équipe d'alarme | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 21 | équipe d'alarme | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 22 | équipe d'alarme | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 23 | équipe d'alarme | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 24 | équipe d'alarme | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_alarme_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 25 | équipe médicale | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 26 | équipe médicale | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 27 | équipe médicale | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 28 | équipe médicale | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 29 | équipe médicale | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 30 | équipe médicale | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_medicale_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 31 | groupe soutien | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 32 | groupe soutien | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 33 | groupe soutien | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 34 | groupe soutien | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 35 | groupe soutien | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 36 | groupe soutien | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_soutien_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 37 | groupe protection | A | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_A` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 38 | groupe protection | B | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_B` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 39 | groupe protection | C | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_C` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 40 | groupe protection | D | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_D` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 41 | groupe protection | F | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_F` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n| 42 | groupe protection | HC | `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_protection_HC` | Shared ship + sea; no fire or role objectives yet |\n\n## Fire-type labels\n\nA = solids; B = flammable liquids/hydrocarbons; C = gases; D = metals; F = cooking oils/fats; HC = special hazards. These are menu categories, not implemented fire behaviors in the empty route maps. See [[Curriculum & Sources]] for lecture mapping.\n\n## Related\n\n[[Menu System]] · [[Fire Drill Scenario]] · [[Ship Environments]] · [[2026-11-05 — Gameplay Updates]]\n\n## Shared ship graphics — 2026-11-07\n\nBoth the default expanded ship and `/Game/NavalFireVR/Scenarios/L_Ship_NoFire` received the ship-wide wall/hardware/material pass. The other 41 routes reference that shared fire-free environment, so the shared visual changes are available there without editing their route definitions. Role-specific gameplay/scenario implementation statuses are unchanged. See [[Ship Realism — Imported Environment]] for scope and verification; no headset/performance test was performed.\n",
