      "excerpt": "The project now has a web dashboard that surfaces the state recorded in this vault.",
      "body": "# Project Dashboard — Status\n\nThe project now has a web dashboard that surfaces the state recorded in this vault.\n\n| Item | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Repository | `Fashion00-s/navalfirevr-dashboard` |\n| Live site | https://fashion00-s.github.io/navalfirevr-dashboard/ |\n| Notes source | this vault — `NavalVault` |\n| Recorded | 2026-11-07 |\n\nEvery note in this vault is exported to the site by `tools/sync-vault.ps1` in the dashboard\nrepository, so anything added here appears on the site's **Vault notes** page after a sync.\nThe dashboard's editable sections are seeded from the tables below and save to the browser.\n\n## Roadmap\n\n| # | Milestone | Status |\n|---|---|---|\n| 1 | Menu and scenario routing | ✅ Done — 42 role × fire routes |\n| 2 | Expanded ship and first drill | ✅ Done — current playable slice |\n| 3 | Equipment locker integration | 🟡 In progress — placed and saved; interactions still to plan |\n| 4 | VR interaction pass | ⏳ Planned |\n| 5 | Graphics, performance, and headset evaluation | ⏳ Planned |\n| 6 | Deployment decision | ⏳ Not started |\n\n2 of 6 done · 1 active · 3 upcoming. See [[TODO — Roadmap]] and [[Menu System]].\n\n## Environment checks\n\n| Check | Status |\n|---|---|\n| Separate scenario maps | ✅ Done |\n| Role and fire scenario menu routing | ✅ Done |\n| French in-game guidance | ✅ Applied — headset readability unverified |\n| Ship signage and readable labels | ✅ Done |\n| Whole-ship environment realism pass | ⚠️ Applied but not verified |\n| Existing expanded ship and kitchen drill | ✅ Done |\n| Play, VR, and frame-rate verification | ❌ Not run |\n\n5 done · 1 recorded but unverified · 1 not started. See [[Ship Environments]] and [[Signage]].\n\n## Equipment lockers\n\nFour wardrobes in **LOCAL INCENDIE** (aft starboard): TPB green, TIS red, TISA navy blue,\nARI petrol blue. See [[Fire Equipment Lockers — MCP Repair & Readability]].\n\n| Locker | Items | Contents |\n|---|---|---|\n| TPB | 7 | Combinaison SERGE thermostable · Ceinture et pochette · Gants · Cagoule · Lunettes de protection · Chaussettes ignifugées · Brassard de couleur |\n| TIS | 6 | Veste de feu · Pantalon de feu · Cagoule · Gants de feu · Casque F1 à visière · Bottes de feu |\n| TISA | 4 | Tenue d'intervention aviation · Casque à visière · Gants · Protection respiratoire |\n| ARI | 4 | Harnais et bouteille (ARICO) · Pièce faciale · Appareil porté, contrôle croisé · ARICF — circuit fermé |\n| **Total** | **21** | 21 independently selectable equipment actors |\n\nAll 21 are placed, saved and labelled (26 TextRender labels). **Readiness is recorded as\nUnknown** in the dashboard: no Play/VR test of the repaired installation exists yet, and\npickup/equip interactions remain future work.\n\n## VR interaction planning\n\nSix planning cards — these are designs, **not** implemented Unreal features.\n\n| Status | Cards |\n|---|---|\n| Planned | Pick up and stow a cylinder · Use a thermal camera · Select and operate firefighting equipment |\n| Designing | Interact with doors and ventilation controls · Equip or remove protective equipment |\n| Ready to implement | Record a report or handoff between roles |\n\n## Graphics and headset\n\n| Item | State |\n|---|---|\n| Headset | ⏳ Undecided |\n| Deployment mode | ⏳ Undecided |\n| Performance budget | ❌ Not set |\n\n**Recorded constraint:** profile Play and a standalone build before setting a performance\nbudget. Headset readability, interaction comfort, frame rate and stability are all still\nunverified. See [[Ship Realism — Imported Environment]] and [[2026-11-07]].\n\n## Codex tasks\n\n7 open · 5 high or urgent:\n\n- Verify locker interactions in Play and VR — High · *prepared but not run in Unreal*\n- Run Play and VR performance checks — High · *not run*\n- Plan pickup and equip interaction for lockers — High · *design only*\n- Set performance budget after profiling — Normal · *blocked by profiling*\n- Check French guidance readability in headset — Normal · *applied but not tested*\n- Confirm headset choice — Urgent · *undecided*\n- Confirm deployment mode — Urgent · *undecided*\n\n## Standing caveats\n\n- The dashboard does not decide anything: headset, deployment mode and performance budget\n  stay Undecided / Not set until deliberately changed.\n- \"Applied\" and \"verified\" are kept separate everywhere.\n- Locker readiness stays Unknown until a real Play/VR check is run.\n\n## Related\n\n[[TODO — Roadmap]] · [[Decision Log]] · [[Project Overview]] · [[Home]]\n",
