      "body": "# 2026-11-06\n\n## LOCAL INCENDIE — fire-equipment wardrobes\n\nFour independent TPB/TIS/TISA/ARI wardrobes and 21 equipment Actors were successfully placed and saved in `L_SECUREX_Expanded` through the Unreal MCP workflow. The installation is in **LOCAL INCENDIE**. Existing room structure and kitchen-drill logic were preserved; old north-wall display props were hidden rather than deleted.\n\nThe labels were then corrected for distance readability: white Roboto distance-field text on navy plates, larger wrapped French text, coloured category heading bands, and enlarged room title. All 26 TextRender components were saved. See [[Fire Equipment Lockers — MCP Repair & Readability]] and [[Docs Index]].\n\n",
